"JSON-encoded credentials handed to the provider factory. Shape varies per "
"provider (api_key + model for hosted, endpoint + model for local). Stored as"
" text rather than per-field so the same column carries every provider's "
"distinct shape; provider modules can add structured fields when they prefer."
